up to 4 players.<br>\u2022 Leaderboards - Show your friends who have the best squad.<br>\u2022 Easy to learn - In no time you will play this game like a pro.<br>\u2022 Quick game - Great to play when the time is short or on the queue for another game.<br>\u2022 Full controller support - Possible to play using keyboards or controllers.<br>\u2022 Remap System - Configure your controls as you see fit.",
